    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "10 Acres of Land For Sale at Rooaun, Creagh, Ballinasloe, Co. Galway \r\n\r\nLot 1 – Folio GY43114 \r\nApproximately 5 acres of good-quality agricultural land with extensive road frontage and the benefit of two separate entrances from the public road. \r\n\r\nThe property includes an old cottage, a slatted shed, and a number of additional outbuildings. The site offers potential for redevelopment or further development, subject to the necessary planning permissions. Water supply is available on site. \r\n\r\nLot 2 – Folio RN9538F \r\nApproximately 5 acres of marginal callow land. This land is about 0.5 km away. This parcel is accessed via a right of way. \r\n\r\nPreference to sell as one lot however may be sold individually or as one holding, subject to interest. \r\n\r\nDirections: \r\nFrom Ballinasloe, take the Roscommon Road (R357). Continue for a short distance and take the first left turn. Proceed down this road and the property is located along this route. For Sale signage erected."
      },
